# Generated interactive viewers. The committed SVGs are the diagrams; these are
# build output from `node build.mjs`. Four near-identical 15,000-line viewers are
# ~60,000 lines of generated markup that SonarCloud reads as new code, scoring
# 93.3% duplication against a 3% gate and carrying every reliability finding in
# the project. Regenerate locally instead.
*.html
